<title>USA: Xpedite to buy POSCO unit.</title>
<headline>Xpedite to buy POSCO unit.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xpedite Systems Inc said on Wednesday it had agreed to acquire the fax service business of PosData Company Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Pohang Iron &amp; Steel Co Ltd, for approximately $2.7 million.</p>
<p>This transaction will enable Xpedite to broaden its service offerings in the Korean marketplace, Xpedite said.</p>
</text>
